---
// Placeholder for the later maintained school-system graphic.
---

<figure
  class="school-system-figure school-system-figure--placeholder"
  aria-labelledby="school-system-chart-title"
  aria-describedby="school-system-chart-description"
>
  <div class="section-header section-header--compact">
    <h2 id="school-system-chart-title">Grafische Übersicht zum Schulsystem</h2>
    <p>Die tabellarische Übersicht unterhalb der Grafik enthält die verbindliche Textalternative.</p>
  </div>

  <p id="school-system-chart-description" class="school-system-chart__summary">
    Die Grafik soll die Bildungswege von der Polytechnischen Oberschule über die Erweiterte
    Oberschule bis zu beruflicher Bildung, Hochschulzugang und Weiterbildung zeigen.
  </p>

  <div class="school-system-chart-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="school-system-placeholder-svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 520" role="img">
      <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__background" x="1" y="1" width="1198" height="518" rx="8" />
      <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__band" x="32" y="32" width="1136" height="76" rx="2" />
      <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__title" x="600" y="72" text-anchor="middle">
        Grafische Übersicht zum Schulsystem
      </text>
      <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__subtitle" x="600" y="94" text-anchor="middle">
        Platz für eine eigenständig erstellte, barrierearm beschriftete Schulsystemgrafik
      </text>

      <g>
        <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__primary" x="76" y="352" width="1048" height="90" rx="2" />
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__label" x="600" y="403" text-anchor="middle">
          Polytechnische Oberschule: Primarstufe
        </text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__secondary" x="76" y="214" width="716" height="118" rx="2" />
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__label" x="434" y="268" text-anchor="middle">
          Polytechnische Oberschule: Sekundarstufe I
        </text>
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__small" x="434" y="294" text-anchor="middle">
          Abschlüsse nach Klassenstufe 9 und 10
        </text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__secondary-light" x="812" y="214" width="312" height="118" rx="2" />
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__label" x="968" y="268" text-anchor="middle">
          Erweiterte Oberschule
        </text>
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__small" x="968" y="294" text-anchor="middle">
          Jahrgangsstufen 11 und 12
        </text>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__vocational" x="76" y="132" width="250" height="62" rx="2" />
        <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__vocational" x="344" y="132" width="250" height="62" rx="2" />
        <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__vocational-light" x="612" y="132" width="250" height="62" rx="2" />
        <rect class="school-system-placeholder-svg__vocational-light" x="880" y="132" width="244" height="62" rx="2" />
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__small" x="201" y="169" text-anchor="middle">Berufsschule</text>
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__small" x="469" y="169" text-anchor="middle">Berufsfachschule</text>
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__small" x="737" y="169" text-anchor="middle">Fachoberschule</text>
        <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__small" x="1002" y="169" text-anchor="middle">Fachschule</text>
      </g>

      <line class="school-system-placeholder-svg__guide" x1="76" x2="1124" y1="342" y2="342" />
      <line class="school-system-placeholder-svg__guide" x1="792" x2="792" y1="194" y2="332" />
      <text class="school-system-placeholder-svg__axis" x="32" y="474">Schulbesuchsjahre / Übergänge</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>
